1. Scope
--------

"Owner" means OldGunslingerWildBill. "Covered Material" means the original
Realistic BWR source code, original models and artwork, build/export tools,
and documentation offered with this license, only to the extent the Owner
owns or is authorized to license that material. It includes the core/ and mod/
modules and compiled forms of Covered Material.

Third-party material and material under a separate applicable license are
excluded. This license does not claim ownership of Minecraft, dependencies,
manufacturer references, other people's artwork, or independent code.

2. Use and private modification
-------------------------------

You may read, download, make local copies of, build, and run Covered Material.
You may edit it privately for your own use and run it on your own servers.
Ordinary gameplay on a server is not redistribution of its source or binaries.
You may send a proposed patch privately to the Owner for review. These
permissions do not authorize publishing a modified version.

3. Redistribution and reuse
--------------------------

You may redistribute an unchanged copy of the complete project or an unchanged
Realistic BWR release, including an unmodified build from unchanged source,
if you comply with section 4 and preserve applicable license notices. An
unmodified Realistic BWR JAR may be included in a modpack on those conditions;
this license does not apply to unrelated modpack contents.

Prior express written approval from the Owner is required before you copy for
others, publish, upload, sell, sublicense, or otherwise redistribute:

  a. a modified version of Covered Material, including modified source, a
     modified fork, a patch containing Covered Material, or a modified binary;
     or
  b. copyrightable portions extracted for reuse in another project, including
     copied or adapted code or assets.

Credit alone is not approval. A request, silence, or public availability is
not approval. Approval must identify the work and the redistribution or reuse
being authorized. Written approval from the Owner's GitHub account is an
acceptable form of approval. Its scope and additional conditions apply; it
does not grant permission for unrelated uses.

Request approval through the project's GitHub issue tracker:
https://github.com/OldGunslingerWildBill/bwr-mod/issues

4. Attribution and accurate authorship
-------------------------------------

Every redistribution authorized by this license must:

  a. include LICENSE and NOTICE, preserving applicable copyright, attribution,
     historical-license and third-party notices;
  b. visibly credit "Realistic BWR by OldGunslingerWildBill" and link to
     https://github.com/OldGunslingerWildBill/bwr-mod in the distribution's
     README, credits or description, as well as with the distributed files;
     and
  c. identify approved modifications and their authors accurately, and mark
     the distribution unofficial unless the Owner approves official status
     in writing.

You must not remove attribution, claim authorship of the original Realistic
BWR work, pass off a copy as your original work, or imply endorsement of an
unapproved version. You may take accurate credit for your own contributions
without obscuring the original project's authorship. Credit to the Owner
does not replace credit owed to another copyright holder.

